0026 | 0.0027 |\n| Real replay | 0.0035 | 0.000068 | 0.000034 | 0.000088 | 0.000069 | 0.00012 |\n\n- **The copy of a copy held.** Under focused dreams the first day's error stayed flat from day 2 to day 6.\n- **Dreams preserve; they don't improve.** Focused dreams kept the first day at roughly the accuracy it had after its own lesson. Real replay kept correcting it and ended about 20 times better, because a dream can only repeat what the network already believes, mistakes included.\n- **Without rehearsal, every past segment was overwritten.** Only the latest day stayed right.\n\nThis is only six days and 8 runs, so drift over a longer stretch isn't ruled out. Experiment 002 has its own write-up in `experiments/002-dreams-of-dreams/README.md`, and `README.md` and `LETTER.md` now link to it.", "finished_at": "2026-10-08T18:25:19.422893+00:00", "inference_provider": null, "inference_route": null, "inputs": [], "migration": null, "mode": "agent", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "provider": "claude", "provider_duration_seconds": null, "provider_error": null, "provider_reported_cost": null, "provider_status": null, "response_available": true, "run_id": "867c55bd-260c-47b5-a3dd-2353e6346475", "session_id": "3d4ff97a-9d19-454b-b764-63f1404ec836", "started_at": "2026-10-08T18:20:52.155466+00:00", "status": "succeeded", "succeeded": true, "task": "f7fdea32-9dd6-4d5b-957a-46aef9f37975", "time_to_first_event_seconds": 1.012271, "time_to_first_response_seconds": 11.040843, "timed_out": false, "usage": {"cached_input_tokens": 835243, "input_tokens": 844900, "output_tokens": 5644, "reasoning_output_tokens": 0}, "usage_schema": "aop-token-usage-v3"}
